# Practice modes

Lesson practice panes are flow-specific. Wiring: `module/…/lesson/…/+page.svelte`.

## Markdown Practice IDE (HLD / LLD / AI)

- Component: `PracticeIDE.svelte` → `IDEWorkspace` + Monaco markdown
- Steps: `getLessonPracticeSteps(lesson)` in `courseData.js` (opening / design / review)
- HLD learning labs (`systems-fundamentals-lab`, `reliability-observability-lab`, `data-storage-lab`, `security-operations-lab`, `distributed-systems-lab`) use lab-oriented structures that pull design-exercise prompts and `likelyAnswerPoints` into guardrails
- AI lessons use ML-oriented structures
- Per-phase mock timer: 25 / 35 / 45 min targets (`practicePhaseLimits.js`); persisted via `practiceAnswers.startAttempt` on step keys
- Workspace id: `practice:{lesson.id}` (IndexedDB)
- Drafts: `practiceAnswers` store (`persistence.mdc`)
- Optional coach: `LlmAssistantPanel` in IDEWorkspace `editor-chrome` — **Check (AI)** + **Configure model** above Monaco (`llm.mdc`)

## DSA Practice IDE

- Component: `DsaPracticeIDE.svelte`
- Dual mode when a lesson has coding `exercises[]`:
  - **Lesson exercises** — starter/solution picker, stdlib Python via Pyodide, expected-output check
  - **Interview drills** — curated `questionHighlights` with Python/C++/Java WASM harnesses
- Defaults to lesson exercises on study labs; practice-only lessons stay on interview drills
- Drafts persist via `practiceAnswers` keys `dsa-exercise:{lessonId}:{exerciseId}` and `dsa-practice:{lessonId}:{frontendId}:{language}`
- Attempt timer: `practiceTimer.js` nested in practice store (`dsa-exercise-attempt:…` / `dsa-attempt:…`)
- **Check (AI)** on code (exercise brief or question statement + draft); does not replace Run

## Question bank IDE

- Component: `QuestionBankIDE.svelte`
- Lesson field: `questionBank: { key, label, kind }` from `questionBankCourseData.js`
- Lazy-loads matching JSON under `src/lib/data/`; normalize with `dsa/questionBank.js`
- Coding solutions are Markdown in JSON; `renderSolutionHtml()` (markdown-it, `html: true`) fills `solutionHtml` for the “Show solution” panel
- Section browser, search, per-question completion in localStorage
- Same Python/C++/Java WASM runners as DSA
- Reading items: “Your answer” textarea → `practiceAnswers` key `question-bank-answer:{bankKey}:{itemId}`
- **Check (AI)** on code or reading draft

## ML Practice IDE (AI + HLD/LLD expansion coding drills)

- Component: `MLPracticeIDE.svelte`
- Runs NumPy / pandas / matplotlib / scikit-learn in `static/ml-py-worker.js`
- When `lesson.exercises` includes coding items with `starterCode`, shows exercise chips + picker, loads starter into the editor, and supports Reset starter / Load solution
- Revealable per-exercise hints; soft output check against `expectedOutput` keywords after a successful run
- Drafts persist in `localStorage` under `ml-practice:{lessonId}:{exerciseId}`
- Shown with the study guide on AI lessons and on HLD/LLD expansion labs that ship coding exercises; every AI lesson ships ≥2 Pyodide-safe coding exercises

## Heuristics and solutions

- “Show likely answer” under prompts: `interviewAnswers.js` (+ optional `likelyAnswerPoints` on lessons)
- Enhanced walkthroughs (12 lessons: 9 case studies + feed-timeline, caching-layers, api-design): `LessonSolutionPanel` + `solutionLoader.js` / `lessonEnhancements.js`

## Orphans

`PracticeWorkspace.svelte` is unused by routes — prefer `PracticeIDE` for new markdown practice.
